    {
      "id": "claim_29f0f40b76494cc1b94297464a312d36",
      "statement": "The _BUILTIN_PROVIDERS registry maps 30+ provider names to tuples of (module_path, class_name, creator_func), enabling dynamic import and instantiation of provider-specific chat model classes without hardcoded provider logic; most providers use a standard _call creator, while special creators handle HuggingFace (from_model_id), IBM (model_id parameter mapping), and LangSmith (gateway configuration injection).",
      "evidence": [
