    {
      "id": "claim_5e30e423925f4d5bbf43bf747c38b092",
      "statement": "Provider inference uses case-insensitive prefix matching on bare model names (e.g., 'gpt-' → openai, 'claude' → anthropic, 'amazon.' → bedrock), with explicit provider:model format taking precedence; inference includes a deprecation warning for 'gemini' models defaulting to google_vertexai (will change to google_genai in next major release).",
