    {
      "id": "claim_0189e22a0f5b41d3ac5ddefc410b2c45",
      "statement": "When configurable_fields is not None or model is None, init_chat_model returns a _ConfigurableModel Runnable that defers instantiation until config is provided at invoke time; _ConfigurableModel merges default_config with runtime config extracted from config['configurable'] (respecting config_prefix namespacing and field whitelisting), instantiates the actual model, applies queued declarative operations (bind_tools, with_structured_output) in order, and delegates streaming/batching to the instantiated model.",
